Diagnostics inside complex string annotations (nodes parsed from the string value, all with
the string range) were reported with fixes that edited the wrong text or panicked on token/range
lookups; report them without fix (or not at all for always-fixable rules).
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-linter-complex-string-annotations.py (ruff_fix_validity).

